{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBBorelCantelli","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBBorelCantelli","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBBoundarySeed"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.branch_gap_lower_of_fract","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.branch_gap_lower_of_fract","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBBorelCantelli.lean#L65-L130","doc":"**No-resonance ⇒ gap lower bound.**  If the resonance `frac s = s − ⌊s⌋ ≥ θ` (`θ > 0`)\nand `q ∈ (1,2]`, then `1 − x·q^{⌊s⌋} ≥ (θ/4)(q−1)`.  Feeds `boundary_term_vanishes`\n(#4270) with `c = θ/4`, closing the boundary term `→ 0` on the no-resonance set.\n\nProof: `1 − x·q^{⌊s⌋} = 1 − e^{−a}` with `a = (s−⌊s⌋)·log q ≥ 0`; `1 − e^{−a} ≥ a·e^{−a}`\n(`add_one_le_exp`); `a ≥ θ·log q ≥ θ(q−1)/2` (`log q ≥ (q−1)/q ≥ (q−1)/2` on `q≤2`); and\n`e^{−a} = q^{−frac} ≥ q^{−1} ≥ 1/2`.  Product `≥ (θ(q−1)/2)(1/2) = (θ/4)(q−1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.branch_endpoint_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.branch_endpoint_eq","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBBorelCantelli.lean#L44-L63","doc":"**Branch-index endpoint identity** `x·q^{⌊s⌋} = exp((⌊s⌋ − s)·log q)`.  Since\n`s·log q = log(1/x) = −log x`, we get `x·q^{⌊s⌋} = exp(−s·log q + ⌊s⌋·log q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.brS_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.brS_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBBorelCantelli.lean#L40-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.brS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.brS","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBBorelCantelli.lean#L36-L38","doc":"The resonance parameter `s := log(1/x)/log q` (`> 0` for `x ∈ (0,1)`, `q > 1`).  The\nbranch index is `⌊s⌋`; the endpoint gap is governed by the fractional part `s − ⌊s⌋`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}